00:56:32.190 --> 00:56:34.700
Are you saying I'm broken?

00:56:35.470 --> 00:56:39.330
Then you should completely break.

00:57:10.220 --> 00:57:11.860
An hour, huh?

00:57:12.300 --> 00:57:13.630
You're excellent.

00:57:14.040 --> 00:57:16.420
But that's also your limit.

00:57:16.720 --> 00:57:20.920
