00:57:21.280 --> 00:57:25.620
The origin will not take shape unless you awaken it.

00:57:25.970 --> 00:57:30.680
The ability of a transcendental man who will not be bound by anything...

00:57:30.680 --> 00:57:34.120
The uniqueness as an extraordinary life form...

00:57:34.880 --> 00:57:36.470
Don't you want them?

00:57:40.490 --> 00:57:42.060
Understood.

00:57:42.360 --> 00:57:44.150
You're the first.

00:57:47.120 --> 00:57:48.870
Who are you?

00:57:51.610 --> 00:57:52.940
Magus.

00:57:54.080 --> 00:57:55.890
Souren Araya.

00:57:56.830 --> 00:57:58.200
What's your name?

00:58:03.530 --> 00:58:04.830
That's regrettable.

00:58:05.190 --> 00:58:09.670
You were one letter away from being a lion.

00:58:15.000 --> 00:58:17.470
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:58:19.270 --> 00:58:24.410
Just being with you and having you smile made me happy.

00:58:25.480 --> 00:58:28.760
It brought me peace of mind, even though I was uneasy.

00:58:30.550 --> 00:58:35.020
Just being with you and walking with you made me happy.

00:58:36.240 --> 00:58:39.900
Being together, even though we weren't together.

00:58:40.710 --> 00:58:45.710
Those really are traces of the dreamlike days.

00:58:49.210 --> 00:58:50.420
<b>Murder Speculation</b>

00:58:50.420 --> 00:58:54.500
<b>(Second Half)
Murder Speculation</b>
